ucial member.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-11-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u4uVfnEwnbSlT8U8rTMAkc850gR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u4uVfnEwnbSlT8U8rTMAkc850gR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/4/episode/37"},{"id":"782113","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":38,"title":{"value":"Un salto verso la vittoria","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Runo meets a new Bakugan named Aerogan, who asks to be her partner. Aerogan must prove himself against Wiseman and his henchmen.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-11-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i7SeUAlJI6RPw3iHL32jz7JSe60.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i7SeUAlJI6RPw3iHL32jz7JSe60.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/4/episode/38"},{"id":"782114","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":39,"title":{"value":"Infiltrazione tra i nemici","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When the Brawlers are finally able to infiltrate Wiseman's stronghold, they are drawn into a vicious battle.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-12-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3aJHTVAquJJffHYN31cTUsjm3we.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3aJHTVAquJJffHYN31cTUsjm3we.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34109/season/4/episode/39"},{"id":"782115","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumber":40,"title":{"value":"Gunz è vivo","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Gunz discovers that Wiseman has morphed and taken on his features! Wiseman finally reveals his dark secret.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2011-12-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t